Creo que la cancion es MUY poderosa por varios motivos (hablo del cover, que es el que me lleg\'f3 m\'e1s profundo)\
La cantante es Namine Ritsu (leer tablitas UTAUloid), que le da una voz como raspy, imperfecta, y MUY potente\
La letra es incre\'edble!!! tanto que sigo en un extended_tablitas\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl320\partightenfactor0
\cf0 When I first saw the original cover of this song, I was a depressed teenager that dropped out of school and had pretty bad life choices made. I was ready to jump off a building somewhere and end things. I related to this song so much and it encapsulated everything I felt at that time. I was lonely, alone, and struggling to sort out how I feel. Then life got better slowly. I listened less and less to this song as I immersed myself in a lot of things and that loneliness was now a thing of the past. YT just randomly recommend me this out of nowhere and all I can say that it has been a long time. Now I'm getting married in a few months and have a child incoming in 3. I have a wonderful job and an absolutely amazing fiance. Idk whats the point of me commenting all this. I guess I can finally say that I'm no longer the error that I felt I was. Thank you for being a part of the toughest moments in my life kyaami.\
es que por este tipo de cosas es TAN importante esta cultura\
estas canciones\
estas historias!!!\
